display h-stat__num">28K+</span><span class="h-stat__label">Users</span></div><div class="h-stat" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 1;"><span class="s-display h-stat__num">2.9K+</span><span class="h-stat__label">Services</span></div><div class="h-stat" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 2;"><span class="s-display h-stat__num">19K+</span><span class="h-stat__label">Active keys</span></div><div class="h-stat" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 3;"><span class="s-display h-stat__num">1.1K+</span><span class="h-stat__label">Protected scripts</span></div><div class="h-stat" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 4;"><span class="s-display h-stat__num">99%</span><span class="h-stat__label">Uptime</span></div></div></section><section id="steps" class="s-section s-rel"><span class="s-ghost" aria-hidden="true">SETUP</span><div class="s-wrap s-stack" style="gap: 56px;"><div class="h-steps-head"><div class="s-stack " style="gap: 20px; max-width: 760px;"><div class="s-kicker " data-reveal="left"><span class="s-kicker__num" aria-hidden="true">01</span><span class="s-kicker__total" aria-hidden="true">/06</span><span class="s-kicker__label"><span>How it works</span></span></div><h2 class="s-display s-h2" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 1;">Panda is <span class="s-blue">easy to use.</span></h2></div><span class="h-mascot" data-reveal="pop"><img src="/landing/panda-working.webp" alt="" width="720" height="752" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></div><ol class="h-stepper"><li class="h-step"><span class="h-step__num" aria-hidden="true"><span>1</span></span><div class="h-step__text" data-reveal="left"><strong>Create a service</strong><p>Give it a name and an identifier. Set key durations, the whitelist and how many checkpoints a key costs.</p></div><figure class="h-shot" data-reveal="right" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-shot__tag"><span>Dashboard · New service</span></span><span class="h-shot__body"><span class="h-shot__frame"><img src="/landing/steps/step-1-create-service.webp" alt="The Create New Service form in the Panda dashboard: service name, identifier, and optional Discord and website links." width="513" height="535" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span></figure></li><li class="h-step"><span class="h-step__num" aria-hidden="true"><span>2</span></span><div class="h-step__text" data-reveal="left"><strong>Share your Get Key link</strong><p>One link per service. Post it in your Discord or script hub.</p></div><figure class="h-shot" data-reveal="right" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-shot__tag"><span>Your Get Key page</span></span><span class="h-shot__body"><span class="h-shot__frame"><img src="/landing/steps/step-2-getkey-page.webp" alt="A Get Key page as users see it when they open the link. The service name, logo and sponsor banner are blurred here." width="1200" height="652" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span></figure></li><li class="h-step"><span class="h-step__num" aria-hidden="true"><span>3</span></span><div class="h-step__text" data-reveal="left"><strong>Users clear the checkpoints</strong><p>Each checkpoint runs on your own ad account and is verified on our server before it counts.</p></div><figure class="h-shot" data-reveal="right" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-shot__tag"><span>A checkpoint · LootLabs</span></span><span class="h-shot__body"><span class="h-shot__frame"><span class="h-cp" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of a LootLabs checkpoint: the user completes a few short tasks, then continues back to the Get Key page. The next checkpoint is on Linkvertise."><span class="h-cp__head" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/monet/lootlabs-icon-64.png" alt="" width="64" height="64" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><strong>LootLabs</strong><span class="h-cp__badge">Checkpoint 1 of 2</span></span><span class="h-cp__title" aria-hidden="true">Complete the tasks to get your key</span><span class="h-cp__tasks" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-cp__task is-done"><i><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg></i>Watch a short ad</span><span class="h-cp__task is-done"><i><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg></i>Visit a sponsor page</span><span class="h-cp__task is-now"><i>3</i>Keep the page open<em>0:09</em></span></span><span class="h-cp__bar" aria-hidden="true"><b></b></span><span class="h-cp__row" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-cp__btn">Continue to your key</span><span class="h-cp__next">Next<img src="/monet/linkvertise_logo_big.svg" alt="" width="79" height="20" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span></span></span></span></figure></li><li class="h-step"><span class="h-step__num" aria-hidden="true"><span>4</span></span><div class="h-step__text" data-reveal="left"><strong>The key binds to one device</strong><p>The first redemption records the HWID. Every check after that has to match it.</p></div><figure class="h-shot" data-reveal="right" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-shot__tag"><span>Key management · Active keys</span></span><span class="h-shot__body"><span class="h-shot__frame"><img src="/landing/steps/step-4-active-keys.webp" alt="The Active Keys list, showing a redeemed key next to the HWID it is bound to." width="731" height="225" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span><span class="h-shot__stamp" aria-hidden="true"><span>HWID locked</span></span></figure></li><li class="h-step"><span class="h-step__num" aria-hidden="true"><span>5</span></span><div class="h-step__text" data-reveal="left"><strong>Your script checks it</strong><p>Key, HWID and service are validated together before any of your code runs.</p></div><figure class="h-shot" data-reveal="right" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-shot__tag"><span>In game</span></span><span class="h-shot__body"><span class="h-shot__frame"><img src="/landing/steps/step-5-in-game.webp" alt="The Panda key prompt inside a Roblox game, asking the player to enter their key." width="518" height="339" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span></span></figure></li></ol></div></section><section id="why" class="s-section s-ground s-rel h-why-sec"><svg class="s-waves" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><defs><pattern id="wv-r3" width="140" height="140" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(-32)"><path d="M-35 70 C 0 25.199999999999996, 35 25.199999999999996, 70 70 S 140 114.80000000000001, 175 70" fill="none" stroke="#D7D7DC" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"></path></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#wv-r3)"></rect></svg><div class="s-wrap s-stack s-rel" style="gap: 56px;"><div class="s-stack " style="gap: 20px; max-width: 760px;"><div class="s-kicker " data-reveal="left"><span class="s-kicker__num" aria-hidden="true">02</span><span class="s-kicker__total" aria-hidden="true">/06</span><span class="s-kicker__label"><span>Why Panda</span></span></div><h2 class="s-display s-h2" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 1;">Panda is <span class="s-blue">always free.</span></h2></div><div class="h-why-grid"><div class="h-talk"><span class="h-talk__portrait" data-reveal="left"><img src="/landing/panda-wave.webp" alt="" width="680" height="744" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div class="h-talk__box" data-reveal="up" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-talk__name"><span>Panda-chan</span></span><span class="h-talk__body"><span class="h-talk__panel"><p>Keys, script storage, obfuscation and monetization: all <b>free</b>. Your ads pay you, and Panda takes <b>no cut</b>.</p><i class="h-talk__next" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></span></div></div><ul class="h-perks"><li class="h-perk is-blue" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 0;"><span class="h-perk__strip"><span class="h-perk__stat"><span>$0</span></span><span class="h-perk__text"><span class="h-perk__tag">01 · Key system</span><strong>Free key system</strong><span class="h-perk__body">HWID-locked keys, checked on our server. Not a trial.</span></span><svg class="h-perk__glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path class="h-perk__glyph-off" d="M15 13a11 11 0 1 0 0 22a11 11 0 1 0 0-22zM15 20a4 4 0 1 1 0 8a4 4 0 1 1 0-8zM25 21h19v6h-3v7h-5v-7h-3v5h-5v-5h-3z" fill-rule="evenodd" transform="translate(3 3)"></path><path d="M15 13a11 11 0 1 0 0 22a11 11 0 1 0 0-22zM15 20a4 4 0 1 1 0 8a4 4 0 1 1 0-8zM25 21h19v6h-3v7h-5v-7h-3v5h-5v-5h-3z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></li><li class="h-perk is-light" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-perk__strip"><span class="h-perk__stat"><span>∞</span></span><span class="h-perk__text"><span class="h-perk__tag">02 · Storage</span><strong>Free script storage</strong><span class="h-perk__body">Host your scripts in Kryptic Vault. Unlimited once you verify.</span></span><svg class="h-perk__glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path class="h-perk__glyph-off" d="M7 6h34v10H7zM34 9h4v4h-4zM7 19h34v10H7zM34 22h4v4h-4zM7 32h34v10H7zM34 35h4v4h-4z" fill-rule="evenodd" transform="translate(3 3)"></path><path d="M7 6h34v10H7zM34 9h4v4h-4zM7 19h34v10H7zM34 22h4v4h-4zM7 32h34v10H7zM34 35h4v4h-4z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></li><li class="h-perk " data-reveal="left" style="--i: 2;"><span class="h-perk__strip"><span class="h-perk__stat"><span>VM</span></span><span class="h-perk__text"><span class="h-perk__tag">03 · Obfuscation</span><strong>Free obfuscation</strong><span class="h-perk__body">Panda-K on every plan. Luraph for verified creators.</span></span><svg class="h-perk__glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path class="h-perk__glyph-off" d="M3 24l13-13 4 4-9 9 9 9-4 4zM45 24L32 11l-4 4 9 9-9 9 4 4zM27 6h5L21 42h-5z" fill-rule="evenodd" transform="translate(3 3)"></path><path d="M3 24l13-13 4 4-9 9 9 9-4 4zM45 24L32 11l-4 4 9 9-9 9 4 4zM27 6h5L21 42h-5z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></li><li class="h-perk is-light" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 3;"><span class="h-perk__strip"><span class="h-perk__stat"><span>100%</span></span><span class="h-perk__text"><span class="h-perk__tag">04 · Monetization</span><strong>Free monetization</strong><span class="h-perk__body">Checkpoint ads pay your own accounts. Panda takes no cut.</span></span><svg class="h-perk__glyph" viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true"><path class="h-perk__glyph-off" d="M3 12h42v24H3zM24 17a7 7 0 1 0 0 14a7 7 0 1 0 0-14zM7 16h5v4H7zM36 28h5v4h-5z" fill-rule="evenodd" transform="translate(3 3)"></path><path d="M3 12h42v24H3zM24 17a7 7 0 1 0 0 14a7 7 0 1 0 0-14zM7 16h5v4H7zM36 28h5v4h-5z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="security" class="s-section s-dark h-vault-sec"><span class="s-ghost" aria-hidden="true">SECURE</span><div class="s-wrap s-stack" style="gap: 64px;"><div class="h-sec__head"><div class="s-stack " style="gap: 20px; max-width: 760px;"><div class="s-kicker " data-reveal="left"><span class="s-kicker__num" aria-hidden="true">03</span><span class="s-kicker__total" aria-hidden="true">/06</span><span class="s-kicker__label"><span>Security</span></span></div><h2 class="s-display s-h2" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 1;">Panda is <span class="h-sec__hl">hard secure.</span></h2></div><p class="s-lead h-sec__lead" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 2;">Your script is protected in three places: where it is stored, the code itself, and the page where players get their key.</p></div><ol class="h-walls"><li class="h-wall" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 0;"><div class="h-wall__card"><div class="h-wall__visual" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: your script goes into Panda’s encrypted servers and reaches the player only after checks; a leaker gets no file."><div class="h-scr h-hv" data-live="true"><div class="h-scr__bar"><span>Kryptic Vault</span><span>encrypted</span></div><div class="h-hv__flow"><span class="h-hv__node"><span class="h-hv__tile"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h8l4 4v14H6zM14 3v4h4M9 12h6M9 16h6"></path></svg></span><b>Your script</b></span><span class="h-hv__arrow" style="--k: 0;"></span><span class="h-hv__node h-hv__node--vault"><span class="h-hv__tile"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 11h14v10H5zM8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3M12 15v2"></path></svg></span><b>Panda servers</b></span><span class="h-hv__arrow" style="--k: 1;"></span><span class="h-hv__node"><span class="h-hv__tile"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8zM4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg><i class="h-hv__ok"><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg></i></span><b>Player</b></span></div><div class="h-hv__thief"><span class="h-hv__who"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.5 9.5C1.5 7.8 2.6 7 4.2 7c2.3 0 4.3 1.4 7.8 1.4S17.5 7 19.8 7c1.6 0 2.7.8 2.7 2.5 0 3.8-2.4 6.5-5.4 6.5-2.1 0-3.6-1.3-5.1-3-1.5 1.7-3 3-5.1 3-3 0-5.4-2.7-5.4-6.5zM5.2 10.6c.9-.7 2.4-.6 3.4.3-.8.9-2.4 1.1-3.4-.3zm13.6 0c-.9-.7-2.4-.6-3.4.3.8.9 2.4 1.1 3.4-.3z"></path></svg>Leaker</span><span class="h-hv__arrow h-hv__arrow--bad" style="--k: 2;"></span><span class="h-hv__no"><b>✕</b> No file to grab</span></div></div></div><div class="h-wall__text"><span class="h-wall__head"><span class="h-wall__num">01</span><span class="h-wall__tag"><span>Kryptic Vault</span></span></span><h3 class="h-wall__title">Secure script hosting</h3><p class="h-wall__body">Your script is stored encrypted on our servers. Players run a small loader instead of downloading your file, and Panda checks their setup before sending anything.</p><span class="h-wall__chips"><span>Encrypted storage</span><span>No file to leak</span></span></div></div></li><li class="h-wall" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 1;"><div class="h-wall__card"><div class="h-wall__visual" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: a readable script is scrambled by Luraph into unreadable code that still runs the same."><div class="h-scr h-obf" data-live="true"><div class="h-scr__bar"><span class="h-obf__label"><i>What you wrote</i><i>What a leaker sees</i></span><span>Luraph</span></div><div class="h-obf__code"><pre class="h-obf__in">local result = PUSL.validate(key)
if result.success then
  openHub()
else
  warn(PUSL.getKeyUrl())
end</pre><div class="h-obf__out"><div class="h-obf__outer"><pre>local lIl1,I1lI=(0x3F*9),{"\x8f\x2c",
"\x41\xd3"};for Il1l=0x1,#I1lI do
lIl1=(lIl1~0x7E)..I1lI[Il1l]end;local
l1I={0x9A,0x1C,0x71};return(function
(...)return(lIl1)(l1I,...)end)(...)</pre></div><span class="h-obf__scan"></span></div></div><p class="h-obf__state"><i>Anyone can read and copy this</i><i><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg> Unreadable, still runs the same</i></p></div></div><div class="h-wall__text"><span class="h-wall__head"><span class="h-wall__num">02</span><span class="h-wall__tag"><span>Luraph</span></span></span><h3 class="h-wall__title">Secure obfuscation</h3><p class="h-wall__body">Luraph scrambles your script before it ships, so a stolen copy is unreadable but still runs the same in game. It comes with verified and paid accounts, and every plan gets Panda-K, our own obfuscator.</p><span class="h-wall__chips"><span>Luraph</span><span>Panda-K on every plan</span></span></div></div></li><li class="h-wall" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 2;"><div class="h-wall__card"><div class="h-wall__visual" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: a player who watches both ads gets a key; a bypass site that skips the ads is blocked."><div class="h-scr h-ab" data-live="true"><div class="h-scr__bar"><span>Your Get Key page</span><span>checked by Panda</span></div><div class="h-ab__lane"><span class="h-ab__who"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8a4 4 0 1 0 0 8zM4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Player</span><span class="h-ab__run"><span class="h-ab__flow"></span><span class="h-ab__cp" style="--k: 0;">Ad 1 <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg></span><span class="h-ab__cp" style="--k: 1;">Ad 2 <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg></span><span class="h-ab__key" style="--k: 2;">Key</span></span></div><div class="h-ab__lane h-ab__lane--bad"><span class="h-ab__who"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="currentColor" fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.5 9.5C1.5 7.8 2.6 7 4.2 7c2.3 0 4.3 1.4 7.8 1.4S17.5 7 19.8 7c1.6 0 2.7.8 2.7 2.5 0 3.8-2.4 6.5-5.4 6.5-2.1 0-3.6-1.3-5.1-3-1.5 1.7-3 3-5.1 3-3 0-5.4-2.7-5.4-6.5zM5.2 10.6c.9-.7 2.4-.6 3.4.3-.8.9-2.4 1.1-3.4-.3zm13.6 0c-.9-.7-2.4-.6-3.4.3.8.9 2.4 1.1 3.4-.3z"></path></svg>Bypass</span><span class="h-ab__run"><span class="h-ab__flow"></span><span class="h-ab__cp h-ab__cp--skip" style="--k: 0;">Skips ads</span><span class="h-ab__end"><span class="h-ab__wall"></span><span class="h-ab__stamp"><span>Blocked</span></span></span></span></div><p class="h-ab__verdict">No real ad views, <b>no key.</b></p></div></div><div class="h-wall__text"><span class="h-wall__head"><span class="h-wall__num">03</span><span class="h-wall__tag"><span>Anti-bypass</span></span></span><h3 class="h-wall__title">Secure Get Key page</h3><p class="h-wall__body">People get a key only after they really finish your ads. Bypass sites that skip them are caught on our server, and you choose whether to block them or just log it.</p><span class="h-wall__chips"><span>Checked on our server</span><span>Block or log</span></span></div></div></li></ol></div></section><section id="pricing" class="s-section s-ground"><div class="s-wrap s-stack" style="gap: 56px;"><div class="s-stack " style="gap: 20px; max-width: 760px;"><div class="s-kicker " data-reveal="left"><span class="s-kicker__num" aria-hidden="true">04</span><span class="s-kicker__total" aria-hidden="true">/06</span><span class="s-kicker__label"><span>Pricing</span></span></div><h2 class="s-display s-h2" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 1;">Panda is <span class="s-blue">for everyone.</span></h2><p class="s-lead" style="font-size: 18px;">Start free and upgrade when you need more: paid plans raise your service limits and Panda Token allowance. The key system itself stays free. Verified creators with 500+ Discord members can get Bamboo Panda without paying.</p><span class="s-label s-only-sm" style="font-weight: 500; text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0px;">Swipe to compare →</span></div><div class="s-snap h-plans"><div class="s-frame h-plan " data-reveal="true" style="--i: 0;"><div class="s-tab "><div class="s-tab__main s-tab__main--ink"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800;">Cub</span></div><span class="s-tab__pill s-tab__pill--light">Getting started</span></div><div class="s-frame__inner "><div class="h-price"><span class="s-display">Free</span></div><ul class="h-plan-list"><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>3 services</li><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>HWID-locked keys and monetization</li><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>10 Panda Tokens a month once verified</li></ul><a class="s-btn s-btn--block s-btn--line" href="/register">Start free</a></div></div><div class="s-frame h-plan s-frame--blue s-snap__first h-plan--featured" data-reveal="true" style="--i: 1;"><div class="s-tab s-tab--sticker" style="--pop: #fff;"><div class="s-tab__main s-tab__main--ink"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800;">Red Panda</span></div><span class="s-tab__pill s-tab__pill--light">Full toolkit</span></div><div class="s-frame__inner s-frame__inner--white"><div class="h-price"><span class="s-display">$25</span><small>/ month</small></div><ul class="h-plan-list"><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>10 services</li><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>Luraph obfuscation</li><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>10 Panda Tokens every week</li></ul><a class="s-btn s-btn--block s-btn--dark s-btn--pop" href="/register">Get Red Panda</a></div></div><div class="s-frame h-plan " data-reveal="true" style="--i: 2;"><div class="s-tab "><div class="s-tab__main s-tab__main--ink"><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800;">Giant Panda</span></div><span class="s-tab__pill s-tab__pill--light">No ceilings</span></div><div class="s-frame__inner "><div class="h-price"><span class="s-display">$49.99</span><small>/ month</small></div><ul class="h-plan-list"><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>Unlimited services</li><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>Custom domain</li><li><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1873D3" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5"></path></svg>80 Panda Tokens a month</li></ul><a class="s-btn s-btn--block s-btn--line" href="/register">Get Giant Panda</a></div></div></div></div></section><section id="testimonials" class="s-section h-chat-sec"><div class="s-wrap s-stack" style="gap: 56px;"><div class="s-stack " style="gap: 20px; max-width: 760px;"><div class="s-kicker " data-reveal="left"><span class="s-kicker__num" aria-hidden="true">05</span><span class="s-kicker__total" aria-hidden="true">/06</span><span class="s-kicker__label"><span>Testimonials</span></span></div><h2 class="s-display s-h2" data-reveal="left" style="--i: 1;">Panda is <span class="s-blue">well known.</span></h2></div><ol class="h-chat"><li class="h-msg h-msg--left h-msg--ink" data-reveal="msg" style="--i: 0;"><span class="h-msg__avatar" aria-hidden="true">SC</span><figure class="h-msg__body"><figcaption class="h-msg__who"><b>Silent Caliber</b><span>Punk X</span></figcaption><span class="h-msg__bubble"><span class="h-msg__line"><blockquote>Setup took about ten minutes. Dashboard is clean, keys just work, and the HWID lock has stopped sharing dead in its tracks.</blockquote></span></span></figure></li><li class="h-msg h-msg--right h-msg--white" data-reveal="msg" style="--i: 1;"><span class="h-msg__avatar" aria-hidden="true">BB</span><figure class="h-msg__body"><figcaption class="h-msg__who"><b>blue ball</b><span>Chosen Hub</span></figcaption><span class="h-msg__bubble"><span class="h-msg__line"><blockquote>Moved my whole script library over. Cut my support DMs in half.</blockquote></span></span></figure></li><li class="h-msg h-msg--left h-msg--blue" data-reveal="msg" style="--i: 2;"><span class="h-msg__avatar" aria-hidden="true">SP</span><figure class="h-msg__body"><figcaption class="h-msg__who"><b>Sebastian Paul</b><span>Skull Hub</span></figcaption><span class="h-msg__bubble"><span class="h-msg__line"><blockquote>Linkvertise + LootLabs side-by-side per checkpoint is what sold me.</blockquote></span></span></figure></li><li class="h-msg h-msg--right h-msg--white" data-reveal="msg" style="--i: 3;"><span class="h-msg__avatar" aria-hidden="true">K</span><figure class="h-msg__body"><figcaption class="h-msg__who"><b>ktrov3</b><span>zzzhub2</span></figcaption><span class="h-msg__bubble"><span class="h-msg__line"><blockquote>The 5-line loader is genuinely 5 lines.</blockquote></span></span></figure></li></ol></div></section><section id="faq" class="s-section s-ground s-rel h-faq-sec"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Panda really free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. The key system, HWID-locked keys, script storage and monetization are on the free plan, with no countdown. Paid plans raise your limits and add Panda Tokens."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I keep my ad revenue?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"All of it. Checkpoints run on your own account at Linkvertise, LootLabs, Work.ink, Ad-Maven or one of the other supported shorteners, and they pay you directly. Panda takes no cut."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the HWID lock work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The first redemption records the device. Every check after that has to match a device the key is bound to, and the server enforces the limit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it only for Roblox?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. There are SDKs for Roblox Lua, C# and C++, and anything else can call the API directly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Kryptic Vault?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Script hosting. Your source stays on our servers, encrypted at rest, and is streamed at runtime only to someone holding a valid, device-locked key."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does a paid plan add?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Higher service limits, Luraph, more contributors and more Panda Tokens. The key system itself stays free.